    "public_preview": null,
    "text": "IT’S HERE!!! ✨ Our debut book Not Sure Who Needs to Hear This, But… is officially out in the world! It’s been a long time coming, and we couldn’t be prouder to share it with you. 🧡 You can order it now at wetheurban.com (link in bio)!\n\nWe truly appreciate each and every one of you for being part of this journey, and hope that this book offers you and your loved ones healing, comfort, and enlightenment whenever you need it. \n\nYour orders this week are so crucial to the success and reach of this book. Supporting indie retailers and Barnes & Noble makes a significant impact and helps us spread our message further. \n\nLeave an “ordered!” below if you purchased your copy! 🫶🏽\n\nThank you so much for your support! 🧡📙✨\n\nBook Details:\n7x7 Hard Cover with Gold Foil\n224 Pages / Six Chapters\nHundreds of Quotes and Affirmations",
